## Anti-Patterns to Prevent

❌ **Synchronous Requests**: Never use `requests` library
❌ **No Timeouts**: Always set timeouts on HTTP requests
❌ **Unclosed Sessions**: Use context managers or explicit cleanup
❌ **Bare Exceptions**: Catch specific exception types
❌ **Blocking Sleep**: Use `asyncio.sleep()`, not `time.sleep()`
❌ **Infinite Retries**: Always limit retry attempts

## Success Metrics

- < 5 second response time (p95)
- < 10% request failure rate in normal operation
- 100% async (no blocking calls)
- Proper connection cleanup (no resource leaks)
- Clear error messages for debugging
